OL,3,AWill it snow this week? Mild Atlantic
OL,4,Aair collides with cold air across the
OL,5,AUK
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK is in the grip of the coldest
OL,8,Fspell of autumn so far, but will it
OL,9,Fresult in snow?
OL,11,FMild Atlantic air that arrived in the
OL,12,Fsouth-west of the UK over the weekend
OL,13,Fis pushing eastwards, coming up against
OL,14,Fcolder Arctic air.
OL,16,FIn this setup, the meteorological
OL,17,Fingredients for snow are in place;
OL,18,Fhowever, there remains uncertainty in
OL,19,Fwhere the boundary between the cold and
OL,20,Fmild air will sit.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
