OL,3,AWill it snow this week? Mild Atlantic
OL,4,Aair collides with cold air across the
OL,5,AUK
OL,6,
OL,7,FEven small shifts in temperature could
OL,8,Fmake a significant difference to what
OL,9,Ffalls from the sky and, crucially, the
OL,10,Fchances of snow.
